<title>FRANCE: Carbone Lorraine 96 sales up 19.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Carbone Lorraine 96 sales up 19.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					3,086  vs   2,579</p>
<p>NOTE - Carbone Lorraine, a unit of Usinor Sacilor, gave its sales figures in a statement. It said turnover rose 19.7 percent and rose 6.2 percent on a comparable structure and exchange rates.</p>
<p>Higher sales resulted mostly from strong growth in North America and Asia. Growth was &quot;very modest&quot; in other regions.</p>
</text>
